  "rationale": "High blood pressure is a leading risk factor for heart disease and stroke. Proper identification and control of hypertension reduces the risk of adverse cardiovascular outcomes.",
  "clinicalRecommendationStatement": "The measure assesses whether eligible patients have their blood pressure under adequate control as determined by the most recent qualifying blood pressure readings during the measurement period.",
